 A2.1 – Recursive Design (2 Marks)

1\. Digital Root

```text
Algorithm DigitalRoot(n)
    if n < 10
        return n
    sum = 0
    while n > 0
        sum = sum + n MOD 10
        n = n DIV 10
    return DigitalRoot(sum)
End Algorithm
```

2\. Power using Recursion

```text
Algorithm Power(base, n)
    if n = 0
        return 1
    half = Power(base, n DIV 2)
    if n MOD 2 = 0
        return half * half
    else
        return base * half * half
End Algorithm
```

* Base case: , return 1.

* Recursive case: Calculate power using and square the result.

